WEBVTT

00:10:57.653 --> 00:11:01.532
to continue this path
that capitalism has put us on,

00:11:01.532 --> 00:11:04.910
we cannot let governments
collaborate with business

00:11:04.952 --> 00:11:07.204
to wreck the engine of the market.

00:11:07.788 --> 00:11:12.167
Weirdos trying stuff
and sometimes being allowed to fail at it

00:11:12.209 --> 00:11:14.461
are our best hope as a species.

00:11:14.503 --> 00:11:15.671
Thank you.

00:11:15.713 --> 00:11:20.759
(Cheers and applause)